Add 3 new Supabase tables (investment_accounts, tax_lots, investment_transactions)
with full schema, indexes, RLS, and dedup constraints. Extend CSV import parser to
auto-detect Chase IRA tax lots and transaction history formats. Wire investment data
through financial-data-service with graceful fallback. Build InvestmentsTab with 4
sub-views: Overview (allocation donut, top positions bar chart, tax term breakdown),
Positions, Tax Lots (sortable), and Trade History. Also includes prior session fixes:
remove hardcoded values from CashFlowTab, NetWorthTab, PromoDeadlinesTab, and wire
propertyTax + assets through Supabase financial_settings JSONB pipeline.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>
